// Open Graph card for api.relayshield.net/developers and the /guides/* pages.
// Generated 2026-07-30 from a 1200x630 PNG; figures on it were live-checked
// against DynamoDB the same day. Served from this Worker rather than API
// Gateway because API Gateway only base64-decodes a binary response when the
// REQUEST's Accept header matches binaryMediaTypes -- and the social crawlers
// that fetch OG images send Accept: */*, which does not match, so they would
// have received base64 text instead of a PNG. Do not edit by hand.
export const DEVELOPERS_OG_PNG_BASE64 = "";
